"radar_help.cycle.p3" = "Then come the ten tilts of the volume scan, in this order: 5.5, 4.5, 3.5, 2.5, 1.5 and 0.5, then 8, 12, 17 and 25. The 0.5° sweep is done about three minutes into the cycle. The 25° sweep ends at about five minutes, just as the next cycle starts. Each sweep file reaches EUMETNET's public bucket of raw radar data about two minutes after it is scanned.";
